BEGIN

Initialize Arduino pins
Initialize I2C
Initialize MPU6050

IF sensor initialization fails
    Stop motors
    Report error
    Halt
END IF

Initialize angle estimate
Initialize PID variables

REPEAT:
    Wait for next control sample
    Read accelerometer and gyroscope

    Calculate accelerometer angle
    Calculate elapsed time
    Update complementary filter

    Calculate angle error

    IF robot has fallen
        Stop motors
        Reset integral
    ELSE
        Calculate P term
        Calculate I term
        Calculate D term
        Calculate PID output
        Limit motor command
        Drive both motors
    END IF

    Print diagnostic information
UNTIL power is removed

END
